## Note on ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN
SQLite has no `IF NOT EXISTS` clause for `ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN`. 
If you encounter a duplicate column name error when running an `ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN` statement in the D1 console because the column was already applied previously, skip and continue.
